   \[
   \text{Mass} = \text{Normality} \times \text{Volume (L)} \times \text{Molar mass}
   \]
   \[
   \text{Molar mass of H}_2\text{SO}_4 = 63.5 + 32 + 4 \times 16 = 154 \, \text{g/mol}
