2. Esterification of fatty acids with polyols
3. Ring-opening polymerization of polyacetylene
4. Enzymatic hydrolysis of natural oils
5. Chemical synthesis of poly(ethylene glycol) derivatives

Each of these processes has its own optimal conditions. However, some general guidelines can be provided:

