\[
V_{\text{final}} = V_{\text{initial}} + V_{\text{standard}} = 100 \text{ mL} + 10 \text{ mL} = 110 \text{ mL}
\]
Substituting the values into the mass balance equation:
\[
C_{\text{initial}} \times 100 = 0.0125 \times 110
\]
\[
