where \( v \) is the velocity after time \( t \), \( v_0 \) is the initial velocity, \( a \) is the acceleration, and \( t \) is the time.  

Thus, the velocity of the sphere after time \( t \) is:  
\[ \boxed{v = v_0 + at} \]
