   \nabla F = \left\langle \frac{\partial F}{\partial x}, \frac{\partial F}{\partial y}, \frac{\partial F}{\partial z} \right\rangle = \langle 2x, 2y, 18z \rangle.
   \]
   At the point \((4, 2, -2)\), the gradient is:
   \[
