   \[ \text{Molar mass of N}_2\text{O}_4 = 28 + 2 \times 16 + 4 = 74 \text{ g mol}^{-1} \]  
   \[ \text{Vapour density} = \frac{74}{74} = 1 \]  
   \[ \text{Vapour density} = \frac{\text{Molar mass of N}_2\text{O}_4}{\text{Molar mass of NO}_2} = \frac{74}{44} = 1.68 \]  

